# winoracle (Windows 11 26200, Microsoft Basic Render Driver / WARP), 2026-09-28.
# x64 and x86 builds print identical lines; the '# d3d11_nv12_probe (N-bit)' banner is a comment.
# Summary: even W/H, 1 mip, ArraySize <= 2, no MSAA/cube/DSV; views R8(_UINT)/R16 = plane 0,
# R8G8/R16G16 (+ R32_UINT UAV for P01x) = plane 1, NULL desc refused; one subresource per slice holding
# both planes (Map RowPitch = W*elem, DepthPitch = RowPitch*H); boxes are luma texels, odd ones dropped.
